OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786951095
OL,3,CReform reveals plan to ban all foreign
OL,4,Cnationals from claiming most benefits
OL,6,FReform UK has announced a suite of
OL,7,Fplans to curb the UK's welfare bill,
OL,8,Fwhich they have labelled "immoral,"
OL,9,FITV News Political Correspondent Tom
OL,10,FSheldrick reports
OL,12,FForeign nationals would be banned from
OL,13,Fclaiming almost all kinds of benefits
OL,14,Funder a Reform UK government, with the
OL,15,Fparty describing the current situation
OL,16,Fas "immoral".
OL,18,FReform said the measure would form
OL,19,Fpart of a wider plan to save more than
OL,20,F#50 billion a year from the welfare
OL,21,Fbill that they announced on Saturday.
OL,26,@xD@DOUxD@LO]
