OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786951095
OL,3,CReform reveals plan to ban all foreign
OL,4,Cnationals from claiming most benefits
OL,6,FThe ban would cover European Union
OL,7,Fnationals with settled status in the
OL,8,FUK, something that would require Nigel
OL,9,FFarage's party to renegotiate the
OL,10,FBrexit deal with Brussels and
OL,11,Fpotentially mean British expatriates
OL,12,Fin the EU losing equivalent rights.
OL,14,FThe proposal to end eligibility to
OL,15,Fbenefits for foreigners would save
OL,16,Faround #21 billion annually by the
OL,17,Ffifth year of the scheme, Reform
OL,18,Fclaimed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
