CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786951095
OL,3,CReform reveals plan to ban all foreign
OL,4,Cnationals from claiming most benefits
OL,6,FThe party had previously pledged to
OL,7,Fban foreign nationals from claiming
OL,8,Funiversal credit, but the new
OL,9,Fproposals cover almost all welfare
OL,10,Fpayments including housing benefit,
OL,11,Fpension credit, jobseeker's allowance,
OL,12,Fchild benefit, free childcare and
OL,13,Fdisability benefits.
OL,15,FReform's Treasury spokesman Robert
OL,16,FJenrick said: "Forcing British workers
OL,17,Fto pay for the benefits of foreigners
OL,18,Fis not just economically illiterate
OL,19,Fbut plain immoral.
OL,26,@xD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786951095
OL,3,CReform reveals plan to ban all foreign
OL,4,Cnationals from claiming most benefits
OL,6,F"People are more than happy to support
OL,7,Ftheir neighbours in hard times, but
OL,8,Fthe British taxpayer cannot afford to
OL,9,Fsubsidise everyone on the planet,
OL,10,Fespecially those who have not paid in.
OL,12,F"The public have been crying out for
OL,13,Fthis change for decades.
OL,15,F"Unlike the two old parties, Reform
OL,16,Fwill deliver a system that's fair for
OL,17,Fthe British people."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@AOUyD@TO]
