OL,3,CReform reveals plan to ban all foreign
OL,4,Cnationals from claiming most benefits
OL,6,FMr Jenrick has already set out
OL,7,Fproposals to transform sickness and
OL,8,Fdisability benefits with the aim of
OL,9,Fsaving #22 billion from the welfare
OL,10,Fbill, and he will make further
OL,11,Fannouncements on Monday.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,18,FThe plan to strip benefits from EU
OL,19,Fnationals with settled status in the
OL,20,FUK would require difficult
OL,21,Fnegotiations with Brussels.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
