OL,3,CReform reveals plan to ban all foreign
OL,4,Cnationals from claiming most benefits
OL,6,FReform acknowledged that Britons
OL,7,Fliving in the bloc could lose their
OL,8,Frights to benefits as a result, and
OL,9,Fthey have estimated a cost of #500
OL,10,Fmillion for expatriates returning to
OL,11,Fthe UK and claiming welfare after
OL,12,Flosing their entitlement to support.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
