OL,3,CReform reveals plan to ban all foreign
OL,4,Cnationals from claiming most benefits
OL,6,FA Labour spokesman said: "These plans
OL,7,Fwould mean ripping up the UK's
OL,8,Fwithdrawal agreement with the EU,
OL,9,Fplunging the UK back into years of
OL,10,FBrexit renegotiations and stripping
OL,11,Fsupport from potentially millions of
OL,12,Fpeople who have lawfully lived, worked
OL,13,Fand paid taxes in Britain for years,
OL,14,Fand in many cases decades.
OL,16,F"That includes people with settled
OL,17,Fstatus who are part of our
OL,18,Fcommunities, raising families, working
OL,19,Fand contributing to our economy."
OL,26,@nD@ZOUxD@AOU{D@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
