FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786951095
OL,3,CReform reveals plan to ban all foreign
OL,4,Cnationals from claiming most benefits
OL,6,FThe spokesman said the "vast majority"
OL,7,Fof migrants had no access to benefits
OL,8,Fand the Labour Government was already
OL,9,Freforming the welfare system.
OL,11,FShadow work and pensions secretary
OL,12,FHelen Whately dismissed the plans as
OL,13,F"cobbled together" proposals that
OL,14,F"will drag Britain back into Brexit
OL,15,Fbattles with no certainty of success".
OL,17,FShe said: "British people want welfare
OL,18,Fspending under control, abuse stamped
OL,19,Fout and dignity for people who are
OL,20,Fseriously disabled: serious reforms
OL,21,Fwhich take hard work."
